777 0 obj
  << /ActualText (  experience\050Product Design Lead \174 CityNet\n   Duration\072 Ongoing\nLed redesign of the core platform that powers B2B sales of tourism services for agencies and partners\nImproved core user flows and overall usability\nDesigned additional platforms including Nik Gaman Charity\054 Nikan\054 and other internal products\nMentored a junior designer through feedback and design reviews\n\050Product Designer \050Remote\051 \174 Tosan Techno\050tipax\051\n   Duration\072 Ongoing\nDesigned a logistics management panel for internal use\nFocused on making workflows simpler and easier for the operations team\nWorked remotely with product and development teams to deliver usable designs\n\n   Product Designer \174 3 Click Group\n   Duration\072 1\0565 years\nRedesigned the company website with a simple and modern look\054 and made it mobile\055friendly\nDesigned a panel \050CMS\051 to manage blog\054 landing pages\054 and other content\nCreated a booking panel for internal teams and partner agencies\nBuilt a design system to keep all parts of the product consistent   \050\050Product Designer \174 Toptours\056\n   Duration\072 1\0563 years\nDesigned a B2B system to sell tickets for places like Tochal and Iran Fun\nAdded features like cancellation\054 tracking\054 and daily task management\nBuilt a version of the system that clients can use with their own brand\nCreated a design system to speed up and organize the design process\n\n   Freelance Product Designer\n   Duration\072 2 years\nDesigned websites\054 apps\054 and dashboards for different startups\nFocused on clear and easy user flows\nDelivered responsive designs with simple documentation for developers\nUsed small design systems to keep the work fast and consistent\n\n   Product Designer \050Remote\051  \174 Chatr Pasargad Co\056\n   Duration\072 1 year\nDesigned a mobile app for Pasargad Insurance agents\nHelped users check insurance info\054 follow payments\054 and access services more easily\nWorked with developers to make sure designs were built correctly)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 778 0 R
